ERROR:  insert or update on table "undo_child" violates foreign key constraint "undo_child_undo_id_fkey"
DETAIL:  Key (undo_id)=(999999) is not present in table "undo_me".
INSERT INTO undo_me (v, create_date) VALUES ('v5', timestamp '2025-04-01');	-- global unique again
ERROR:  duplicate key value violates unique constraint "undo_me_v_key"
DETAIL:  Key (v)=(v5) already exists.
SELECT count(*) FROM dbblue_partition_status('undo_me');
 count 
